WEBVTT

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:07.480
What will you do?

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:09.230
Who will you kiss?

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.990
Decide, Hayate-kun.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.990
Chapter 2: I Will Love and Be Loved in My Life

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.840
I will defeat you!

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:53.840
For my kiss!

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.500
What is this place?

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:22.730
I was just in the park...

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:24.120
Glad you dropped in.

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.560
You guys...

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.370
How're things going?

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.620
With the kiss, of course!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.720
You'd better work hard, or something

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:33.630
terrible will happen to your mistress!

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.130
I am trying hard!

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.460
Now, now...

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.130
How about some tea?

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:43.890
Nagi?

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:46.390
Wake up, Nagi.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.280
<i>Hayate-kun, where are you?</i>

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.050
An idol cannot be tainted.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.590
They are, indeed, gods.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:09.410
I could talk about this 
until the sun goes down.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.730
The sun is definitely down...

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:16.060
Sorry, I have to go!

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.420
Please wait, Ruka-san!

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:20.190
I'll return the butler uniform!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.700
Ruka-san!

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:23.640
Now, hold on.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.560
I have a plan.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.000
If you kiss someone...

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:29.770
make it Chiharu.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:31.520
Chi-Chiharu-san?

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:35.410
Yes. Chiharu is weak under pressure.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.150
<b>Chiharu Harukaze</b>

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:39.980
Ayasaki-kun?

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.750
I need to ask you for 
an important favor.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.160
Could you lend me your time?

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:45.500
I'm working right now...

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:48.750
You're the only one who 
can help me with this!

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:53.170
Okay, I get it. 
I'll ask if I can leave early.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:57.060
Yes. Yes. Then I'll see you 
in Underdog Park at 6:30.

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.510
Thank you.

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:03.180
Now, if you just beg on your hands 
and knees with tears in your eyes,

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:05.940
she'll agree to kiss you.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.070
I see...

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:10.390
Well, I have important 
business, so I'll be going.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.900
I have time. I'll go back 
to the apartment first.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.940
<i>Maybe I should've waited 
at the apartment...</i>

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:31.290
<i>If Hayate-kun hasn't kissed anyone yet,</i>

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:32.790
<i>I could—</i>

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:34.790
Hm? Hina-san?

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:38.350
What brings you out here?

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:40.670
I'm looking for Hayate-kun.

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:44.880
You, too? So, that story was...

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:47.300
The kiss, you mean?

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:52.190
We're so...

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.750
Hopeless!

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:56.810
I'd like to hear about this in detail.

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.250
I have to get that kiss, this time.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.820
Why are you dressed like that?

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.720
A-tan...

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.070
It looks like you've been wrapped 
up in something troublesome again.

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:12.590
Yeah... If I don't kiss 
someone, Miss Nagi will...

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:14.400
If you'd said so in the first place,

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.710
you wouldn't have to go to such pains.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:20.380
I don't mind kissing you.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.510
Really?!

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:27.970
Thank you, A-tan!

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:36.120
That's a crime!

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:36.980
Father?!

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.980
Just try kissing that young girl! 
You'll be arrested in no time!

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:42.870
Stay out of this!
 It's none of your business!

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.490
Oh, yes, it is!

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:47.740
I will not forgive anyone who 
tries to kiss such a young girl!

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:50.740
Because this young girl is not a girl!

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.070
She is an angel!

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:53.740
A girl is a girl!

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.520
Can't you just kiss anyone?

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:57.180
That's right! Anyone is fine!

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:58.740
Then it doesn't have 
to be a young girl?!

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:00.000
I told you, anyone is fine!

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.720
Now, Chiharu-san is my only hope.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.350
Armageddon!

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:26.610
I'll just have to go like this!

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.710
I think a kiss is like

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.620
Nope, I still can't reach Hayate-kun.

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:39.790
a reward that shows someone 
how much you care about them.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.100
So nobody's seen him since then?

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.970
By the way, "kisu" read 
backwards is "suki."

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:45.760
Where could he be?

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.410
In other words, it is 
both a reward and...

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:48.920
Look! There's someone 
funny-looking out there!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.860
You were looking for Hayate-kun, too?

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:58.840
Yeah. I need to return this to him.

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:01.380
Hayate-kun's butler uniform?

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:03.190
What's this about?

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:06.290
Well, actually...

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:11.640
We're starting the shoot.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:12.490
Okay.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.370
And, action!

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:29.630
I'm sorry, Hayate-kun.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:32.890
No, I'm sorry for jumping out in front.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.020
Incidentally...

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:36.130
Was this really the 
only outfit you had?

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:38.890
Don't worry, it looks great on you.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.300
I'll have the wardrobe staff 
clean up your butler uniform.

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:45.260
So, you wanted to ask me something?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.820
W-Well... it's...

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.900
You need help, right, Hayate-kun?

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:53.430
Is it about that dream?

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.770
So you had it, too?

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:58.990
You tried to kiss me...

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:00.660
I'm sorry.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:05.420
I wouldn't mind... if you kissed me.

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.880
What? But I haven't 
explained anything...

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.810
I don't need to hear it.

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:17.180
You wouldn't be so troubled 
for just any silly reason.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:20.430
I'll...

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.280
Ruka-san...

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:25.060
I won't let you!

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:28.420
Kayura-san?!

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:31.890
Even if it's you, I won't stand for it.

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:33.030
Wh-Why not?!

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:34.910
Because Ruka is...

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:36.410
an idol.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:39.490
An idol is a god to her fans.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:40.910
Because they believe she is a god,

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:41.330
<b>Time</b>

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:43.010
they give their time, 
money, and lives!

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:41.690
<b>Money</b>

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:42.650
<b>Life</b>

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:45.410
She is worth all of it!

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:47.840
Um, is this going to take long?

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.670
Shut up and listen. Sit.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.920
You see, an idol is...

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:58.180
Strange... I wonder what happened.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:01.180
Underdog Park

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.950
Hello, Chiharu-san?

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.900
Ayasaki-kun, I'm sorry!

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:25.700
I called the apartment, but...

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.560
Forget about that. Where are you?

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:30.040
Actually, I haven't 
gotten off work yet...

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.840
Then, let me give you 
this phone's number.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:34.340
Uh-huh. Uh-huh.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:35.700
Got it.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.050
So, when the part-timer comes back...

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:41.000
Is that... Just a second.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.230
Okay, I'll wai—

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:44.140
Good evening.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:46.850
What? Sakuya's not here?

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:49.360
Where'd she go?

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:52.110
Where'd she go, indeed...

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:05.190
You sure are bold, Ruka.

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:07.720
Well, he seemed to be in trouble...

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:09.650
Sympathy is not the same as love.

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:12.780
They're close enough.

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.040
So, what happened to Hayate-kun?

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:14.880
Hey, you guys!

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:16.880
There's someone 
funny-looking out there again!

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:22.840
<i>This sucks.</i>

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:26.640
<i>Chiharu-san isn't coming, 
and people are staring at me.</i>

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:36.900
Wait!

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:49.620
<b>Garbage Site</b>

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:51.180
Are you all right, kid?

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:52.250
Let's get him to the hospital!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.710
Let me out!

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.230
Release... Unlimited.

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:02.470
Again! Again!

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.220
Release...

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:06.250
So, about Hayate-kun...

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:07.980
Right. Kayura...

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:10.910
You were with Hayate-kun
 after that, right?

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:11.750
Yeah.

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.400
Where is he now?

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:16.730
By the way, what is that outfit?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:19.650
I'm glad you asked. 
This may take a while.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.890
You see...

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:30.980
Chiharu-san?!

00:11:30.980 --> 00:11:33.380
Ayasaki-kun? I finally 
got a hold of you!

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:35.380
Where are you?

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.630
Sorry. I'm still not off work.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:39.630
It shouldn't be much longer...

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:42.890
Please! If I don't do 
something by midnight,

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:44.390
something terrible will 
happen to Miss Nagi!

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:48.970
If I knew what you wanted me to do,

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:51.140
I'd do my best to help here, too...

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:53.100
Then I'll just come out and ask!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:55.060
Chiharu-san,

00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:56.820
I want to kiss you!

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:03.070
K-Kiss? What are you 
saying, Ayasaki-kun?

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:14.130
<i>Something terrible will 
happen to Miss Nagi!</i>

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.340
So you see,

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:22.090
it's an anime that caters to the 
delusions of middle school kids.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:25.230
I could talk about this until 
today becomes tomorrow.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.100
It's already 11:30.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.520
I have to go look for Hayate-kun!

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:32.270
What's wrong, Hina?

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:35.020
I can't get in touch with Hayate-kun.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.020
I wonder where he's gone off to...

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:39.510
Doesn't this happen all the time?

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:42.030
If you want the butler, 
he's in Underdog Park.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.020
What?

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.910
Chiharu Harukaze

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:51.340
Hello, Chiharu?

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:54.820
Listen, Ayasaki-kun is acting weird...

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.920
I have to kiss someone... Anyone!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:01.670
That's right.

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:05.730
Hayate-kun wouldn't say 
something like that so flippantly.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.300
I'm going to the park.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.860
Nagi-chan's just sleeping, isn't she?

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:13.560
A kiss would be...

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:16.570
If that's all I can do for him...

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:19.320
But wasn't it just a dream?

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:21.800
Whether it's a dream or not,

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:23.690
if Hayate-kun needs help,

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:26.070
I want to do what I can for him.

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:28.310
Hina-san...

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:30.420
Me, too!

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:31.450
Yeah!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.170
Guess I have no choice.

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.500
Hayata-kun is mad about me, after all.

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:44.970
What?

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:46.900
Are you being serious right now?

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:47.760
Huh?

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:53.400
Someone... Anyone will do...

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.650
I know I said anyone will do, but this?

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:06.580
There's no time!

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:16.580
I'm sorry, Sensei!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:18.490
I'm going to kiss you!

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:26.470
What're you doing, kid who
 looks like Ayasaki-kun?!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.760
Please let me kiss you, Sensei!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.820
I'll explain everything later!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:31.640
Please!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.540
Kiss? Sure...

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:36.390
If you can...

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.890
defeat me!

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:42.090
He did say midnight, right?

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:52.700
Here I come!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.450
What was that?

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:38.140
<i>So the alcohol took effect...</i>

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:40.910
<i>I still defeated her, right?</i>

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:42.710
<i>There's no time...</i>

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:45.930
I'm going to kiss you.

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:48.960
Hey, Yukiji!

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:51.550
Where are you?

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:55.930
Sleeping in a place like this again?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.190
You'll catch a cold.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:03.770
You're a hundred years 
too early to kiss me!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:06.020
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:09.030
Bring on the liquor!

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:12.080
Jeez, there's no helping you...

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.080
Ah, warm...

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.000
Come on...

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:26.790
Hayate-kun...

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:34.870
Hina, where's Ayasaki-kun?

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:35.890
I haven't found him yet.

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.600
Really...

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.270
That Hayate is too much trouble.

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:47.520
What am I doing?

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:51.970
Even if it is for Miss Nagi, 
I can't force someone to kiss me.

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.030
Everyone...

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:00.040
Why don't you change into this first?

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:05.030
This is quite the battlefield.

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:06.790
I might actually feel sorry for him.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:08.790
All right!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:13.300
How did it turn out like this?

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:16.300
That good-for-nothing 
butler's in a bind now.

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.310
You need help, right?

00:17:20.840 --> 00:17:22.560
You have to kiss someone, don't you?

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:24.560
So, who's it going to be?

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.400
Maybe we set the bar too high.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.820
How can you say that now? 
This was your idea, you know.

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:37.390
Yeah, but we'll never see him again.

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.330
What's wrong with one last little game?

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.780
We really miscalculated, though.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:43.790
Why doesn't he get it?

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.760
That's why he's such 
a good-for-nothing!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.050
It didn't go as we expected,

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:52.340
but I do think he's trying his best...

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.590
No! It's not enough!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:57.890
Get it together, Hayate Ayasaki!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:59.850
What about Hayate?

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:01.530
Yikes!

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.850
Hayate?

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:08.090
What's going on here?

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:09.730
Um...

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:14.180
He's being faced with the 
ultimate decision... I guess?

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:16.650
All to save Nagi-chan.

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:18.790
Me?

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:26.420
I don't really get it,

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:29.500
but this is what happens when 
I take my eyes off him for a second.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.880
Honestly...

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.000
Honestly, Hayate!

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.890
What will you do?

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.640
Who will you kiss?

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:43.390
Decide, Hayate-kun.

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:51.770
That won't be necessary.

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:54.670
M-Miss Nagi!

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:59.460
What are you doing?

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:10.540
You shouldn't, Nagi... 
not when you're so shaky...

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:14.920
Nothing to worry about.
 I was just dozing off a little.

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:21.880
Miss Nagi...

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.080
The black camellia?!

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:29.940
<i>The cries of the black camellia...</i>

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:32.310
<i>Then, Miss Nagi is still...</i>

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:43.660
Let's go home, Hayate.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.660
But if I don't kiss someone, you'll...

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:48.660
That doesn't matter.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:50.410
It does matter!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.420
He's right!

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:53.430
We want to help.

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:55.420
It's for your sake, right?

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:57.960
Are you okay with that?

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:02.340
Are you okay with kissing 
someone for a reason like that?

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:09.290
It doesn't matter.

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:13.600
You don't have to go through 
so much trouble for me.

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:14.860
But...

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:20.280
If I stay there, I won't be able to buy
 <i>Sunday</i> at the convenience store,

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:22.360
and I won't be able to 
check out the newest anime.

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:26.410
That may be terrifying in itself...

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:30.560
But I don't mind.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:34.290
You're more important to me.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.540
Miss Nagi...

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.210
I'm not worried about anything.

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:42.120
No matter what happens...

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:44.300
I've got you, Hayate.

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:52.140
You'll protect me, right?

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.560
Because you're my butler.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.440
<i>I will protect you.</i>

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:05.930
Miss Nagi!

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:12.330
I'm sorry.

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:16.870
Even if it was for you,

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:19.840
it was wrong of me to 
ask for a kiss so easily.

00:21:23.680 --> 00:21:25.320
I finally realize now...

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:31.810
A kiss is something
 that everyone treasures.

00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:36.410
I can't just take 
something so precious.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:49.200
But still, I don't want you 
to stay asleep forever.

00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:53.280
Please wake up, Miss Nagi.

00:22:08.990 --> 00:22:12.390
Good morning, Miss Nagi.

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:26.510
Wait a minute!

00:22:28.510 --> 00:22:30.090
Huh? What?

00:22:30.090 --> 00:22:32.750
That was the kiss you 
were talking about?

00:22:32.750 --> 00:22:34.180
What the heck?

00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:38.260
All that fuss over a little 
peck on the forehead?

00:22:38.260 --> 00:22:40.140
Oh, that's a relief...

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:42.670
I figured it was something like that.

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:44.540
That's so like you, Ayasaki-kun.

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:45.670
It sure is.

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:49.080
I-I thought it'd be something 
like that from the start!

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:49.930
Oh?

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:51.840
Wait a minute!

00:22:51.840 --> 00:22:54.430
What kind of kiss were 
you all imagining?

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:55.640
Well...

00:22:55.640 --> 00:22:56.930
You know...

00:22:56.930 --> 00:23:01.190
Jeez... Use a little common sense here!

00:23:01.550 --> 00:23:04.190
You're one to talk!

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:07.440
Well, I guess all is well now.

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:09.880
I'm relieved.

00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:11.450
He really had me on edge.

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:13.450
Nagi will be fine.

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:16.900
She has all these great 
friends by her side.

00:23:16.900 --> 00:23:17.760
Yeah.

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:21.180
Did you see what you wanted to see?

00:23:21.570 --> 00:23:23.710
Sure was a close call, though.

00:23:24.300 --> 00:23:26.710
I'm glad he made it in time.

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:33.720
Shall we go, Yukkyun?

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:35.220
Yes.

00:24:03.560 --> 00:24:06.670
Hayate! Hayate!

00:24:06.950 --> 00:24:09.170
Yes! I'm coming!
